{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id252055373"}, "name":{"label":"Katie199886"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-08T23:15:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"11024363311"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic - one adjustment pllleease"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app\nFantastic price point - finally someone who gets it people will pay £10 a year not £80 !\n\nAll the tasks I log are just tasks and I’d love just a “tick button” that says “all day” rather than having to press the 3 dots and manually change to change to all day\nSounds silly bit I’m sure a lot of people just have tasks they need to do with no time", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
