{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id414706660"}, "name":{"label":"Trewtreng"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-03T23:44:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"11006427015"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant app !"}, "content":{"label":"It has taken me a while to be disciplined enough to actually ‘structure’ each day !\nBut I’m realising how good this is for me- no more drifting through my day, rarely getting things on my written list done . \nThanks to my adult son for setting this up for me- he said it changed his life and I now see what he meant . \n\nIf you’re like me and like to be organised but rarely am , then don’t hesitate, sign up to Structure and don’t give up on first day. \nIt’s very easy once you get the way it works.\nI spend a short time first thing most days, readjusting the day if necessary- things crop up right?! Relax it’s easy to drag the events and change . \n\nSorry to all the tech users out there for the basic comments , not all of us find new apps  easy in retirement!! \nThanks to the guys @ Structure !!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
